<!doctype html>
<html>
<body>
<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
<h1 style="color: #4CAF50;">Reward Generated Successfully - WattsUp Energy</h1>
<p>Dear {{name}},</p>
<p>Great news! Your reward for energy generation verification for <strong>{{month}}/{{year}}</strong> has been successfully generated on the blockchain.</p>
{{#if rewardAmount}}
<p><strong>Reward Amount:</strong> <span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #4CAF50;">{{rewardAmount}} tokens</span></p>
{{/if}}
{{#if transactionHash}}
<p><strong>Transaction Hash:</strong></p>
<p style="background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace; word-break: break-all;">{{transactionHash}}</p>
<p>You can view this transaction on the blockchain explorer using the transaction hash above.</p>
{{/if}}
<p>Your reward tokens have been added to your wallet. You can check your balance by logging into your account.</p>
<p>Thank you for contributing to clean energy generation!</p>
<p>Best regards,<br>WattsUp Energy Team</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>


